  "notes": "Region is not checked (the prompt leaves it to the deployer). Per-AZ 'dedicated' NAT/route table pairing is only checked by counts. 'Public subnets share one route table' is checked as a 0.0.0.0/0 route to the IGW; the association of each public subnet to that one table cannot be expressed (no chained selectors). The S3 endpoint association is not restricted to the private tables for the same reason. The Karpenter discovery tag value is not stated, so only its presence is checked. Optional tiers are default-off, so they are checked as declared; their own route tables and 'no internet' routing are not checked."
